# Xcode per-user window/UI state. Regenerated whenever the project is
# opened, and meaningless to anyone else. The test1 scheme now lives in
# penteLive.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/xcschemes/, so `-scheme test1` no longer
# depends on anyone's xcuserdata/. What is still tracked under xcuserdata/
# (breakpoints, xcschememanagement.plist) is left as-is deliberately; whether
# to drop it is a separate decision.
*.xcuserstate
